{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>商台《叱咤樂壇流行榜頒獎典禮》最新五強名單昨日正式出爐，賽果卻出現令人大跌眼鏡的驚人逆轉。原本備受外界看好的古 …</p><p></p>\n<p>商台《叱咤樂壇流行榜頒獎典禮》最新五強名單昨日正式出爐，賽果卻出現令人大跌眼鏡的驚人逆轉。原本備受外界看好的古天樂與首度殺入七強的宣萱，竟然在這一輪投票中雙雙慘遭淘汰出局。這對經典螢幕情侶原本有望在頒獎台上再度合體，如今卻因為女方的一番言論而令整個局面徹底改變。</p>\n<h2>宣萱出席聖誕活動大談《叱咤樂壇流行榜頒獎典禮》選情</h2>\n<p>宣萱昨日現身公開聖誕活動時，對於自己意外打入「我最喜愛女歌手」七強名單感到極度不可思議，更直言「真的好癲」。當時她透露即將放大假休息充電，當被問及會否效法古天樂在社交平台發布「黑圖」為自己拉票時，她隨即笑指對方「人已好黑」。她當時極度看好男方勝算極高，強調自己只做過演唱會嘉賓，而對方至少曾經推出過實體唱片，對這位多年拍檔充滿絕對信心。</p>\n<h2>晉級五強期望落空 女主角無須備戰輕鬆過聖誕</h2>\n<p>面對外界對兩人同台的熱烈期盼，宣萱在活動上曾經立下明確承諾，坦言自己從未想過能夠在音樂頒獎禮上獲獎。她當時向大眾派定心丸，表示若然真的收到大會通知成功晉身五強階段，放完長假回港後便會立刻「上堂練歌」，以防屆時需要上台獻唱會因為過度緊張而失準。豈料這番豪言壯語剛剛落下，最新一輪投票結果隨即揭曉，她與古天樂雙雙在五強止步，令這個練歌大計瞬間宣告流產，大假過後無須急於趕往學唱歌，可以無壓力地輕鬆度過佳節。</p>\n<h2>古天樂曾奪男歌手獎令《尋秦記》粉絲期待合體</h2>\n<p>自從古天樂於2018年破天荒奪得「我最喜愛男歌手」殊榮後，大批樂迷與影迷一直引頸以待，渴望他能再次踏上這個標誌性舞台。今年適逢宣萱以黑馬姿態驚喜入圍，外界原本滿心期待這對《尋秦記》經典拍檔能夠一同殺入最後五強。不少粉絲甚至幻想二人能夠一同練歌，並在1月1日頒獎禮當晚聯袂領獎兼開金口獻唱，重現昔日螢幕情侶無敵默契，再創香港樂壇經典一幕。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議宣萱發揮驚人燈力</h2>\n<p>兩人齊齊出局的消息一出，隨即在各大網上討論區引發海量網民熱烈討論。大批網民將焦點放在女方早前的言論上，紛紛留言笑指宣萱「燈力」驚人。不少人戲稱她才剛剛開口大讚古天樂勝算極高，轉頭便親自將對方「燈走」，連累這位最佳拍檔一同落選。雖然大批期待「古宣合體」的粉絲大呼可惜，留言表示「還我尋秦記CP」，亦有網民留言直指大會賽果出人意表。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176710227778993131_13456046376953d74646d17.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"宣萱 尋秦記 古天樂宣萱《尋秦記》首映禮合體亮相（圖片來源：東方新地）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176710227778993131_13456046376953d74646d17.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>「尋秦記CP」古天樂 宣萱一同落選（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515483752710351_16066660166affe395ed77f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"saPuclqLbspp5sNXiAtuF1oE1Xd04kGPUeE5kVHhOZE.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515483752710351_16066660166affe395ed77f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：古天樂IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/177147070681650356_205659927169967f7316e4d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"尋秦記 古天樂 宣萱非常活潑，睇到古天樂都「嚇親」（圖片來源：YouTube@天下一）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/177147070681650356_205659927169967f7316e4d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>宣萱非常活潑，睇到古天樂都「嚇親」（圖片來源：YouTube@天下一）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176831579468327723_93094304769665b930ef6e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"宣萱 古天樂 （圖片來源：YouTube@Viu1HK）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176831579468327723_93094304769665b930ef6e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube@Viu1HK）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515483873519183_13833035766affe39734fba.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"iOdulDRoklUmnanSGyveS_4J_RhPb--XxlsQwcZbEME.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515483873519183_13833035766affe39734fba.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>古天樂出賣宣萱拉票（圖片來源：古天樂IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515484017097600_9867312776affe39896c9b.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"OS (1).png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515484017097600_9867312776affe39896c9b.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：fb相片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515484370218457_3741401916affe39c0835c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IG@ensonlau 的副本 - 2026-11-20T134938.624.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515484370218457_3741401916affe39c0835c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：fb相片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8f%a4%e5%a4%a9%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">古天樂</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8f%b1%e5%92%a4%e6%a8%82%e5%a3%87%e6%b5%81%e8%a1%8c%e6%a6%9c%e9%a0%92%e7%8d%8e%e5%85%b8%e7%a6%ae/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叱咤樂壇流行榜頒獎典禮</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%ae%a3%e8%90%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宣萱</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3546688\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 20 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:44:01.851517+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1441,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:07:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:28.409391+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T07:37:27.962010+00:00","content_hash":"2eca62af09a984901742077dd204f135d44f8cf73d6b8bc8b30b539b2f6080f9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}